OL,3,GNEWSAUS pilot arrested at Heathrow
OL,4,Aadmits drugs offence
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn American pilot has admitted
OL,7,Fpossessing cocaine after being arrested
OL,8,Fat Heathrow Airport earlier this month.
OL,10,FWayne Sigler, 64, from Louisiana, was
OL,11,Fdetained by police on Sunday 1 November
OL,12,Fand appeared at Uxbridge Magistrates
OL,13,FCourt on Saturday. After pleading
OL,14,Fguilty to the possession offence he was
OL,15,Fplaced into custody, the Metropolitan
OL,16,FPolice confirmed.
OL,18,FHe has also been charged with being
OL,19,Fdrunk or unfit to fly while flying or
OL,20,Fworking on an aircraft - two offences
OL,21,Fthat fall under the Railway and
OL,22,FTransport Act 2003.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
